PATH RESOLUTION NOTE (no silent drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt's "Output" path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Battery/**`
does NOT match this repository. The real, build-compiled convention (project.yml
compiles `apps/apple/Sources/**`, and every sibling Battery page — SleepEfficiency,
BatteryDegradation, BatteryCells, Energy* — lives under it) is:

    apps/apple/Sources/Features/Battery/**

The page was implemented there so it actually compiles into the iOS + macOS app
targets. `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Battery/` is NOT a compiled source root in
project.yml; placing the file there would produce dead, uncompiled code (a covenant
#4 "stub as final" violation). This is a faithful interpretation of the artifact's
intent ("the Battery feature directory"), not scope narrowing. Identical resolution
to the SleepEfficiency / BatteryDegradation predecessors.

